OL,3,GNEWSAFears diversion bridge 'will cause
OL,4,Abad accident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FVillagers are angry at having to use an
OL,7,F"unsuitable" small bridge as part of a
OL,8,Fdiversion route for years and fear a
OL,9,Fserious accident is "only a matter of
OL,10,Ftime".
OL,12,FHamsterley in County Durham only has
OL,13,Ffour roads leading in and out of it and
OL,14,Fthe C31 has been closed since January
OL,15,F2023, with the diversion route leading
OL,16,Florries and vans over Linburn Beck.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
PN,44302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F443A1786999992
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57iG2/2
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFears diversion bridge 'will cause
OL,4,Abad accident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal Reform UK county councillor
OL,7,FRobert Potts said the pinch point at
OL,8,Fthe bridge over the beck had been the
OL,9,Fsite of a number of traffic accidents
OL,10,Fand had itself been hit on several
OL,11,Foccasions.
OL,13,FDurham County Council's structures
OL,14,Fmanager Andrew Lough said inspectors
OL,15,Fwould visit to assess the bridge for
OL,16,Fdefects.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
